 leaves the farm secret out for it. Servers must be updated before the apps; docs/protocol-15.md has the design and the rollout (written by Astra)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vpnhood/VpnHood","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:15:53Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"aba3678bc27687bada56c0006afe0ab1ca3026d2","github_link":"https://github.com/vpnhood/VpnHood/commit/aba3678bc27687bada56c0006afe0ab1ca3026d2","commit_subject":"Server: once the HTTP read-ahead buffer is back in its pool, a tunnel read goes straight to the connection, instead of taking the buffer's lock on every read for the connection's life; HttpReadStreamTest covers a disposal and a cancellation after the handoff (written by Astra)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ar-io/ar-io-node","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:15:51Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"10e14cd4d1ae41731dedba634aef4eeb01a2d421","github_link":"https://github.com/ar-io/ar-io-node/commit/10e14cd4d1ae41731dedba634aef4eeb01a2d421","commit_subject":"fix(graphql): negotiate GET exemptions with Apollo's exact media types","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Zipstack/unstract","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:15:13Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"67d59d70ad52599077d301f0e026f9f48340daf5","github_link":"https://github.com/Zipstack/unstract/commit/67d59d70ad52599077d301f0e026f9f48340daf5","commit_subject":"UN-4514 [FIX] Cut per-document workflow-execution fetches and stop loading every file-execution row on each one (#2377)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"rvdbreemen/OTGW-firmware","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:14:19Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"5544e8a639f198d9b0cffa64b85a8a2773728eae","github_link":"https://github.com/rvdbreemen/OTGW-firmware/commit/5544e8a639f198d9b0cffa64b85a8a2773728eae","commit_subject":"docs(backlog): TASK-1473 release gate AC reworded for implementation","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"rvdbreemen/OTGW-firmware","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:14:03Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"373fee3062f5c73a4a1993